2026-07-27T14:56:08.6942543Z [36;1m# CXXnnSTD variable (CXX17STD = -std=gnu++17, ...) and applies it on top[0m
2026-07-27T14:56:08.6943056Z [36;1m# at compile time, so wrapping only CXXnn with ccache is correct and we[0m
2026-07-27T14:56:08.6943467Z [36;1m# must NOT pin -std here ourselves.[0m
